  abstract = {Post-secondary education has increased in importance for economic prosperity and in cost, which has led to rising student debt in many nations. Researchers have lagged in determining how student debt affects new post-secondary graduates and, in particular, how it affects the labour market transitions of new university graduates? This dissertation explore this topic using nationally representative data on 2010 Canadian graduates.},
